{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18911","headline":"洛中送崔司业使君扶侍赴唐州 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中送崔司业使君扶侍赴唐州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿野芳城路，残春柳絮飞。\n风鸣驌驦马，日照老莱衣。\n洛苑鱼书至，江村鴈户归。\n相思望淮水，双鲤不应稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}